AutoVirt QEMU and EDK2 stealth patches, vendored.

Origin:    github:Scrut1ny/AutoVirt at 190569cc940fb5366b095d5ca70b478769e65216.
           The upstream GitHub account is not always reachable;
           scripts/update.sh reports when it goes and when it comes back.
Local:     AMD-v11.1.3.patch and Intel-v11.1.3.patch are this repo's port of
           upstream's v11.0.3 patches, and both v11.0.3 patches carry this
           repo's fix for duplicate ACPI device names (EHC1, XHC1).
License:   the patches derive from QEMU (GPL-2.0-or-later) and EDK2; the added
           hw/net/rtl8125.c declares GPL-2.0-or-later. AutoVirt's own scripts
           were GPL-3.0 and are deliberately not vendored here.
